# Rust
/target
**/*.rs.bk
*.prof*

# Secrets and noise. Not `.env*`: `.envrc` is committed and is how direnv finds the flake.
.env
.env.*
*.log
# Connection details for a test server, kept out of the history because it holds a password.
server.md

# Node / Tauri frontend
node_modules/
crates/desktop/ui/dist/
crates/desktop/ui/.svelte-kit/
# Generated by tauri-build from tauri.conf.json and capabilities/
crates/desktop/gen/

# Nix / direnv
.direnv/
result
result-*

# Capture harness working state — goldens themselves ARE committed
tools/capture-reference/.cache/
tools/capture-reference/.venv/

# Editor and OS noise
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
.DS_Store

# Release artefacts from `just release`.
/dist/
